(footprint "DTM13-12PA"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "TE Connectivity DEUTSCH DTM13-12PA, sealed automotive PCB header receptacle, 12 positions, RIGHT ANGLE (90deg) molded pins, FLANGED front panel mount, key A (sleeve retainer GRAY); DEUTSCH size 20 contacts, 7.5 A per contact with all circuits energised (16/18/20 AWG), 250 VDC, -55..+125 degC, durability 20 mating cycles (EIA-364-09, NOT 100 like the DT series), 20 G / 10-2000 Hz per 108-151010 rev F (11OCT2022). ONE FOOTPRINT FOR ALL FOUR KEYS: DTM13-12PA (gray) / PB (black) / PC (green) / PD (brown) differ only by the keyway in the plastic shell - the four TE STEP models were compared and their 12 pin cylinders are identical. Mates with DTM06-12S*-XXXX plug (* = A,B,C,D) + WM-12S wedge lock. Geometry from TE customer drawing DTM13-12PX rev D1 (ECR-21-108593, 05AUG2021) + application spec 114-151047 rev A1 (11JUN2021) sec.3.4, cross-checked against TE STEP model C-DTM13-12PA, agreement 0.001 mm. PCB layout: 12x finished hole D1.30 +/-0.05 (pin D0.99 +/-0.12), column pitch 4.191, row pitch 6.35; 2x NPTH D3.43 +0.12/-0.00 for #4-20 Plastite 48 thread-forming screws (torque 0.68-1.13 Nm), 17.78 mm apart, 12.70 mm toward the panel from the pin-1 row. Pins 1-6 are the UPPER mating row and land on the row furthest from the panel (Y=0); pins 7-12 the lower row (Y=6.35). Mating axis sits 18.034 mm above the PCB top surface; pins protrude 3.05 +/-0.64 below it. Panel inner face (seal land) is 23.368 mm from the pin-1 row (Dwgs.User line); flange 60.96 x 33.02, overall body 60.96 (X) x 38.21 (Y); the shroud protrudes 12.446 mm in front of the panel; cutout centre at X=+10.4775, 18.034 mm above the PCB top. Panel cutout option 2: 41.28 x 21.49, 4x R3.18, plus 2x D4.06 for #6-19 screws on the screw axis 49.53 mm apart (torque 1.24-1.46 Nm); flat sealed area 60.96 x 33.02 min, 4x R7.62 min, Ra 0.8, flatness 0.12; panel 6.25 mm max. CAVEAT: application-spec fig. 3.4 is drawn as seen from the connector underside; this footprint follows the STEP model and the mating-face/rear views of the drawing. 108-151010 rev F rates IP68/IP6K9K for the INLINE plug+receptacle with rear protection only - headers and flanged versions are listed Not Tested. https://www.te.com/en/product-DTM13-12PA.html")
	(tags "connector DEUTSCH DTM DTM13 12 pin position right angle 90deg flange panel mount sealed automotive TE size 20 7.5A header receptacle key A gray")
